& [Purpose]
  + promote only exact in-memory source excerpt recovery needed to move from semantic discovery to inspectable evidence

& [Requirements]
  + [CISE-001] replay the exact six-file mixed-root source snapshot at81936 bytes and preserve the protected live C state
  + [CISE-002] implement a separate safe-Rust effect-free cantor_sop_excerpt crate
  + [CISE-003] accept only a complete diagnostic-free sealed ProjectAssemblyResult
  + [CISE-004] independently replay the assembly envelope semantic manifest generation and result digest
  + [CISE-005] accept exactly one validated record identity under profile cantor-sop-source-excerpt-request/0.1
  + [CISE-006] return the complete text and zero-to-length span for a supplied SourceDocument
  + [CISE-007] return the declared exact SourceSpan for kind context unit relation-type relation rule and view records
  + [CISE-008] distinguish unknown_record from source_unavailable for a known package
  + [CISE-009] refuse absent source invalid range overflow and non-UTF8-boundary spans
  + [CISE-010] return logical path source SHA256 span SHA256 and exact text without host path interpretation
  + [CISE-011] bind assembly digest generation request identity and result fields with separated SHA256 domains
  + [CISE-012] provide strict deny-unknown-field request and result machine forms with one JSON value only
  + [CISE-013] bound request result and recovered text before unbounded work or allocation
  + [CISE-014] replay-validation must produce the exact deterministic result or refuse
  + [CISE-015] promote only kernel.sop.source-excerpt through the instance contract
  + [CISE-016] keep the whole cantor_scribe candidate held
  + [CISE-017] expose no filesystem database index transport execution provider update remote or effect surface
  + [CISE-018] pass constructive adversarial static-absence debug and overflow-checked release tests
  + [CISE-019] pass locked offline serialized exact workspace debug and release plus warnings-denied Clippy and format
  + [CISE-020] retain independently replayable source custody component and workspace evidence
  + [CISE-021] attribute every changed file and intentional transitive evidence refresh to this slice
  + [CISE-022] publish only after exact completion signature staging attribution non-force push and direct remote equality

& [AcceptanceGates]
  + [CISE-A01] exact Unicode declaration and full-source recovery are constructive and deterministic
  + [CISE-A02] every envelope record span and digest tamper refuses
  + [CISE-A03] static absence proves caller-owned in-memory values are the only data plane
  + [CISE-A04] focused and complete workspace evidence agree with zero failures and governed ignores only
  + [CISE-A05] publication records exact implementation and immediate bookend commits without merge or runtime authority

& [Excluded]
  + filesystem source loading SQLite persistence index search ranking neighborhood completion evaluation impact references authoring LSP MCP provider model process hosted runtime self-update remote machine product effect and merge

& [Status]
  + formed_for_exact_bounded_implementation_only
